      "id": "claim_5eb5dfb06e7e486b9498fb30bd1b850b",
      "statement": "The optional Lambda image Containerfile uses a digest-pinned UBI9 Minimal base in both builder and final stages; builder exports frozen runtime dependencies from uv.lock and installs wheels into /deps, while final ships a Python 3.11 interpreter with copied handler and dependencies and uses awslambdaric as the Lambda Runtime Interface Client.",
