      "statement": "The create-investigation Lambda Containerfile intentionally omits a USER directive because AWS Lambda always overrides the container's runtime identity with its own non-root user regardless of what the image specifies, which is unrelated to the separate ECS Fargate investigation container's own sre-user privilege-drop requirement.",
