    {
      "id": "claim_c291648cfc504cb5a57cac4ae72e0415",
      "statement": "The create-investigation Lambda's own Makefile builds the ZIP artifact by installing dependencies inside the official public.ecr.aws/lambda/python:3.11 image for Linux-compatible wheels (make deps/build/package), and separately builds and pushes the optional container image from the same Containerfile via build-image/push-image targets; both packaging paths ship identical handler.py logic, so the ZIP/image choice affects only delivery of the Lambda's code, not its trigger, authentication, EFS access-point, or ECS task-launch behavior.",
